msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Recently Added rows on Home"
msgstr "Righe Aggiunti di recente nella Home"

#: src/qml/UserPreferencesForm.qml:594
msgid ""
"Checked libraries get no Recently Added row on Home. Their tiles, Continue "
